WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.600
No ifs, ands or buts!

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.270
I'm not abandoning Shingetsu!

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.950
A...Astral?

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.280
Astral!

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.910
Astral!!

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.140
Yuma...

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.770
It seems...the time I spent with you ends now...

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.600
Gilag...

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:31.080
His skills are comparable to Misael and Alit.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.560
I'm sorry, but we can't fight together any longer.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.020
Yuma, I entrust the cards to you.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.760
Astral...

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.980
It seems Astral has reached his limit, doesn't it?

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:55.530
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.540
What's that guy thinking?

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:00.820
Kotori! Take this!

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.210
Yuma!

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.620
Please take care of Astral!
I can't lose this Duel, no matter what!

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:16.220
I will definitely protect Astral and Shingetsu!

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:17.600
Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.970
Ha, you fool!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:24.140
Without Astral, you still wish to defeat me while protecting that guy?

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:27.230
Ha! Now I end my turn.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.220
I'm also... capable of protecting myself!

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.450
My turn! Draw!

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:36.480
I Summon Shining Sly!

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:40.020
With this card, when there is an Xyz Monster on the field,

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:42.280
my opponent cannot attack me!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.080
I set one card and end my turn!

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.200
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, now I'll be fine on my own!

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:54.770
Got it!

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.680
My turn! Draw!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:00.220
I Summon Gogogo Golem!

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:08.340
<i>Although the enemy's Giant Hand can negate Monster Effects,
its Attack Power is very low.</i>

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:11.880
<i>Since there's no set card on Gilag's field, now's the chance!</i>

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:15.650
<i>I will destroy it with Hope and attack him with Golem!</i>

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:19.620
Go, Hope! Attack Giant Hand!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.070
Hope Sword Slash!

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.290
Hope! What's the matter?!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.780
Your Monster is already finished.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:32.750
What?!

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:44.490
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:50.460
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.170
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.520
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.600
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:13.110
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.480
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:18.700
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:23.240
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.370
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.080
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.540
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.590
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.050
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:42.090
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.850
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.310
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:51.020
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:03:51.140 --> 00:04:00.070
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.770
Hope!

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.400
Wh... why...?!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.940
It self-destructed?

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:26.620
"The Pulse of V: The Super Rebirth: Hope Ray V!"

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.820
Self-destructed? Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.700
Just now, the moment it received Giant Hand's
Fatally Paralyzing Pressure Point Strike,

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.210
its fate was already decided!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.670
What?!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.630
The Monster who received the
Fatally Paralyzing Pressure Point Strike,

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:42.470
when it battles, it will explode with a "bang" afterward!

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.340
How can that be?!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:48.140
That's not all! You will also receive
 damage equal to Hope's Attack Power!

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:52.600
Have a good taste of Giant Hand's true terror!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.140
I won't let you do that!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.940
I activate Shining Sly's Monster Effect!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.280
When Effect Damage occurs, Shining Sly...

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.910
... that player releases one Monster he controls,

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.120
and negates the damage!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.200
Now Yuma-<i>kun</i> can evade the damage!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.420
You fool!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.090
I activate Giant Hand's effect!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.750
When my opponent activates a Monster Effect,

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.170
by detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.590
I can negate that effect!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:30.140
Monsters' Fatally Paralyzing Pressure Point Strike!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.650
Shining Sly is...!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.940
Damn!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.480
Now, take this once again!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.240
The damage equal to Hope's Attack Power!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.240
Quintuple Fatal Eye Beams!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.250
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:06.800
In the end, not only did you fail to protect your friend,

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.300
but his Monster left the field for nothing,

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.430
and now even your own Monster cannot attack as well!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.430
N-No way!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.770
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.400
I'm so sorry!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.900
It's all my fault for doing unnecessary things!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.150
Don't worry about it!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.280
But...

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.860
Let's think of other ways!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.450
<i>Although... I only have 900 Life left and Gilag is untouched.</i>

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.160
<i>If I am attacked during his next turn...</i>

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.750
I activate a Continuous Magic, Swords of Sealing Flame!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:45.500
As long as this card is active, both players can't attack!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:51.720
However, when there is a Monster Summoned on my field,
this card will be destroyed!

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.310
<i>With this, I can at least survive for now.</i>

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:58.310
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I was the one who made things worse...

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:01.650
Didn't I say not to worry about it? We're friends, after all.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:02.940
Friends...

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.150
Right?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:05.860
Yes!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.610
With this, I end my turn!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:12.820
Are you bastards still pretending to be nice
and playing your game of friendship?!

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.830
Then let me rip off those hypocritical masks of yours!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.080
My turn! Draw!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.250
It's here at last!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.000
The card that will bury you!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:27.170
I activate the Rank-up Magic, Barian's Force!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:32.300
This card can Rank-up Giant Hand,

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:35.050
and Special Summons a Chaos Xyz Monster!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.260
Here comes the Chaos Number!

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:41.230
I Overlay the Rank Four Giant Hand!

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:47.650
I use this Monster to rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:55.200
<i>This... This Chaos Number...</i>

00:07:55.410 --> 00:08:01.460
<i>To... to use it, I have to make a contract with it, even if it depletes my life!</i>

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.460
<i>My life is depleting... continuously depleting...</i>

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.050
<i>But I will bear with it...</i>

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.880
<i>Take a good look, Alit!</i>

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.510
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.860
Come forth, Chaos Number 106!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:42.910
O power capable of dragging the world into chaos!
 Its fist smashes the very Earth...

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.460
It's fingertips will pierce the skies!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.260
Tha... that's...

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.810
Giant Hand - Red the Molten Fist!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.890
So this is that guy's Chaos Number!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.900
I activate Giant Hand Red's effect!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:10.780
By detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:16.320
it negates the effects of all face-up cards except this one!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.870
Scarlet Desert Negation!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.580
Swords of Sealing Flame!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.660
Now there is nothing that can protect you!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.420
Giant Hand Red, attack Yuma directly!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.340
Shoot!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.000
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.470
Crimson Palm of Certain Death!

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:40.180
Trap, activate! Shining Stunt!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:46.140
Due to this card's effect, my opponent's attack is negated,
and the Battle Phase is ended!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.270
Shingetsu!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.150
Afterwards, half of its Attack Power is inflicted onto me...

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.280
...as damage!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.610
Shingetsu!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.960
Shingetsu!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.540
D-Did I help at least a bit?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.420
Shingetsu... you...

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.010
You stupid idiot! Why are you being so reckless?!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.390
How foolish!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.470
To think that you would stand out and take the damage yourself...

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:30.150
<i>I'm almost at my limit as well. if I don't settle this soon...</i>

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:34.780
I set two cards!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:40.320
Then, from my hand, I activate the Field Magic, Erosion Hand Forest!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.080
Thanks to its effect, every time my turn comes,

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.620
each player will be inflicted 1000 points of damage!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.040
What?!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.550
Your remaining Life Points are 900 and 100,

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.260
which means...you're already finished!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.810
What?!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.060
What on earth is happening?

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:18.280
No idea. But...the only thing we can do now is believe in Yuma!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.620
Yuma... Yuma!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.620
We only have one turn left.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.450
Yuma-<i>kun</i>,

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.830
This time for sure, no matter what happens...

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.540
... you must not try to save me!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.050
It doesn't matter what happens to me, so...

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.260
You...

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.420
What are you doing?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.510
It's far too late for this useless attempt at a struggle!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.760
You're already finished!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.060
How can we give up?!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.180
My turn! Draw!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:56.900
I Summon Shining Rabbit from my hand!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:05.910
Then I activate a Magic Card, Shining Bridge!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.450
With this card's effect,

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.500
Shining Rabbit can attack the opposing player directly!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:23.630
Then, when its Direct Attack is successful,
it can destroy a Magic Card my opponent controls!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.180
I see! So his goal is to destroy the Field Spell?!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.020
Go, Shining Rabbit!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.940
I won't let you do that! I activate a Trap! Vice Hand!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.530
With this card, when there is a "Hand" Monster on my field,

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:42.740
I can negate the attack from a Monster my opponent controls!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:52.120
Then the Attack Power of that Monster who's attack was negated...

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.420
...800 points, will be inflicted to that player as damage!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.420
Shoot!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:02.760
It's over! Apologize to Alit as you burn inside the infernal flame!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.600
Wh...What?!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.570
The Trap card, Desperate Guard!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.740
Desperate Guard?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:28.910
With this card, by paying half of my Life Points,
 the damage is negated!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.330
Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.800
You're an idiot!
There's a limit to your friendship game, you know!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:46.220
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I already told you 
not to worry what happens to me!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:49.510
How can I ever do that?

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.550
But...

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.310
You and Astral are all my friends.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:58.810
Therefore I...won't ever abandon either of you!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.940
Yu...Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:05.940
Here I go! My turn! Draw!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.950
You just don't know when to call it quits!

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:11.330
Trap, activate! Death Hand!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:17.290
When a player draws a card
while he controls no Monsters, this card activates.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:22.090
For every card that player has in his hand,
he will receive 300 points of damage!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.590
I've got three in my hand, which means 900 damage...

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.260
Now it's over for real! Yuma Tsukumo!!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.360
I activate a Trap, Shining Reborn!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.940
By releasing two Monsters on my field,

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:49.200
and sending all cards in Yuma's hand to the Graveyard...

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.200
M...my hand cards!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:56.750
What?!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:01.710
Without anything in the opponent's hand,
the effect of Death Hand is meaningless!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.840
You bastard!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.920
Shingetsu... you...

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.630
Then, due to Shining Reborn's effect,

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:11.640
I can Special Summon an Xyz Monster
from Yuma's Graveyard to Yuma's field!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:16.970
Be revived, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.850
He managed to call back the Number!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.560
Shingetsu...

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.940
Then the last effect of Shining Reborn!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:30.700
I set one card from my hand on my opponent's field!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.910
Yuma, use this!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:36.120
Huh?!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.620
This is...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.870
The Rank-up Magic, Limited Barian's Force?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.040
It says "Barian"... Is this...?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.800
A Barian?!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.510
Shingetsu... Why would you...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.260
I'll explain that to you later.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:57.060
Weren't we going to win this Duel and save Astral?

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.770
Believe in me, Yuma.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.650
<i>I've got a Barian card...</i>

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.490
<i>Shingetsu, it's pretty ironic, huh?</i>

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.490
<i>I do believe you.</i>

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.120
I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.620
I activate the Rank-up Magic, Limited Barian's Force!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:29.630
This card targets one Rank Four or lower Xyz Monster on my field,

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:35.720
and a Chaos Xyz Monster that is 
one Rank higher than that Monster...

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.300
...evolves from it!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:43.230
I use Aspiring Emperor - Hope to rebuild Overlay Network!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:47.690
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.080
Come forth, Chaos Number 39...!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.880
Crimson Conquerer, who unifies the Chaos!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.460
Release the Eternal Seal!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:15.340
And with a Flash, sweep away the darkness!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:20.680
Descend, Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray V!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:31.020
Thi... this is Hope's evolution...

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.320
Right. It's your new power.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.990
That's Hope's...

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.240
...new evolution?!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.370
What on earth is happening inside that field?!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.830
Impossible!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.830
That Number raised its Rank?!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.000
There is no way for a human to possess such power!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:50.880
Go, Yuma!!

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.880
Yeah! Hope Ray V's effect activates!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:58.760
Once per turn, by detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:02.100
I can destroy one Monster on the field!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:08.100
Go, Hope Ray V! Destroy Giant Hand Red!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.990
Hope Ray V, V Blade Shoot!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:25.290
Then the Attack Power of the destroyed Monster
will be inflicted as damage to the opponent!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:40.430
I'm <i>not</i> done yet! Hope Ray V, attack Gilag directly!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:48.440
Hope Sword V-Shaped Slash!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.450
We... We won...

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.580
Y-You...!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.500
What the hell...<i>are</i> you?!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.130
You'll know eventually...

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.630
Eventually.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.970
Now what's happening there?

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.980
I can't see anything inside!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.440
Yuma!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.400
Gilag...

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:35.320
Yuma, I was moved.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.400
The way you care for your friends is genuine.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:42.860
From now on, I will address you as a friend as well.
 A <i>real</i> friend that is.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.490
Wa...wait a sec!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.620
I... don't have a clue at all what's happening here!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:51.210
Shingetsu, just what are you...

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.250
I'm a Barian Guardian.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.040
Barian... <i>cardigan</i>?

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.970
It's <i>guardian</i>. Just like the police in your world.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.970
Which means...

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.680
Th-Then... You're a <i>Barian</i>?!

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:15.270
Yuma!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.400
And Shingetsu too!

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.110
You both won!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.610
Good job!

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.360
All thanks to Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.530
It seems I was always dragging Yuma down.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.450
Stop the laughing.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.540
I meant well though...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.040
Yuma, this...

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.750
But we don't want that!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.330
Oh, thank you!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:43.590
Yuma... won... it seems?

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.390
Thank you.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:50.270
Then, same with Astral, too?

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:54.310
Yes, I could see him from the very beginning.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.980
What's that supposed to mean?

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:01.530
My mission is to find the evil Barians and eliminate them.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:04.820
So there's bad and good within the Barians as well?

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.070
Of course. The Barian World is <i>not </i>an evil world.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.370
There are righteous people as well.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:16.250
Starting today, I will protect Astral along with you.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.040
Really?!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.290
Great!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:23.670
When Astral knows we got a Barian friend,
 he'll definitely will be surprised!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.380
This is the secret between you and me.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.390
Why?

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.220
That's what's been decided.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:33.850
Within this world, I have to act as Rei Shingetsu.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:36.480
Sounds troublesome to me.

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:40.400
Therefore, please keep the secret for my sake.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:41.940
Alright, understood!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:46.660
Yuma, starting from today, you're my subordinate.
I'm counting on you.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:50.410
Subordinate... ? Not as a <i>partner</i>r?

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:51.280
It's <i>subordinate</i>.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.910
Ah, I see....!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:02.590
Alright then! Starting today, I'll be the Detective Bringin' it to the Barian Police!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.220
Wait, Shingetsu, save me!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:24.440
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:32.120
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:39.710
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:47.050
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.590 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:19.120
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:27.670
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:38.770
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:45.770
When I finally recovered the true memories from the Numbers, a mysterious giant suddenly appears!

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:48.570
It seems he's examining something.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:51.280
The Duel within Emperor's Key starts!

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:53.320
Wh-What's with that guy?!

00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:55.620
You're Number 96!

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.160
Yuma has disappeared!

00:23:57.160 --> 00:24:00.210
At this rate, we'll get defeated by that guy!

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:02.670
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.090
"Fighting Together with Dark Astral:
The Challenge Towards the Giant of Shadows!!"

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:09.590
My true memory lies beyond that!
